        "de-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "948ea7fa-9a27-314e-bd57-820d552c01e7",
                "word": "vermöge",
                "pos": "prep",
                "lang_code": "de",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                        "entry_id": "948ea7fa-9a27-314e-bd57-820d552c01e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "durch, mittels, wegen, auf Grund von, kraft"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary",
                            "outdated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddf81629-8aa4-4e87-a6f2-5528fa32a346",
                                "sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                                "text": "Vermöge dieses kleinen Lemmas lässt sich nun die Behauptung beweisen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "632b853c-ce01-47e6-bedd-fccdadc756da",
                                "sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                                "text": "„Besitzt jemand eine Sache als Nießbraucher, Pfandgläubiger, Pächter, Mieter, Verwahrer oder in einem ähnlichen Verhältnis, vermöge dessen er einem anderen gegenüber auf Zeit zum Besitz berechtigt oder verpflichtet ist, so ist auch der andere Besitzer (mittelbarer Besitz).“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32d24832-4f11-45cb-b556-407a1a543538",
                                "sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                                "text": "„Er begutachtete die Garderobenschränke als sinnreich, besonders die Vorrichtung, vermöge welcher der Schirm außen aufgehängt, jedoch nur nach Aufsperren der Schranktür abgenommen werden kann.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9eb94bf-9d1b-4672-b812-259bda44e728",
                                "sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                                "text": "„Sobald diese Menschen aus dem von Kanonen- und Gewehrkugeln durchflogenen Raume heraus waren, ordneten die Kommandeure, die hinter ihnen stehengeblieben waren, sie unverzüglich wieder zu geschlossenen Formationen, in denen Disziplin herrschte, und führten sie mit Hilfe dieser Disziplin wieder in die Feuerzone zurück, wo sie vermöge der Furcht vor dem Tode die Disziplin wieder verloren und wieder, geleitet von den zufälligen Eingebungen des Augenblicks, durcheinanderwogten.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43d7c97f-ad31-499e-9666-c7f1296ac76e",
                        "source_entry_id": "948ea7fa-9a27-314e-bd57-820d552c01e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                        "source_sense_description": "gehoben, veraltend, mit Genitiv: durch, mittels, wegen, auf Grund von, kraft",
                        "target_lang_word": "by virtue of",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "by virtue of",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                        "entry_id": "761ad760-402c-36f0-b587-28e235139a6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(originally) By the authority or power of; (now) because of; on the grounds of; by reason of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed0ca269-1be7-4e11-b81c-4f7b66a7c211",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "Moreouer the perfit beleue of this article, worketh in all true chriſten people, aloue to continue in this vnitie, and afeare to be caſte out of the ſame, and it worketh in them that be ſinners and repentant, great comforte, and conſolacion, to obteine remiſſion of ſinne, by vertue of Chriſtes paſſion, and adminiſtracion of his ſacramentes at the miniſters handes, ordained for that purpoſe, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f6f46cd-4805-4019-9c5c-f762800a4134",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "But in the high Court of Parliament, every Man by virtue of the King's Authority, by Writ under the Great Seal, hath a judicial Place; and ſo conſequently the killing of every of them had been a ſeveral Treaſon, and Crimen læſæ Majeſtatis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "125ae90c-a0ce-4633-be4b-a610a735ba58",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "I call that an Inſtitution that hath an efficacie in it for the attaining of ſuch an end by virtue of the Inſtitution, not by virtue of any naturalneſſe that is in the thing. [...] So in preaching the Word, and Eccleſiaſticall cenſures, there is more to be expected, more efficacie to work upon the ſoule, for the ſpirituall man; by virtue of the Inſtitution, then there is in the naturall things that are done there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce1fc38-aba1-42c1-a145-a5d720f29c3f",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "[Samuel Keme] became [...] a retainer, if I miſtake not, to the family of Edward Wray of Ricot Eſq, Patron of the ſaid Church, by virtue of his marriage with Elizabeth the dau[ghter] and heir of Francis L[ord] Norris Earl of Berks[hire]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a2710c2-c5ed-4c33-a8b8-950cc70a10db",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "[W]e found there was but one way; Don Clavijo ſhould demand the young lady in marriage before the curate, by virtue of a promiſe under her hand, which I dictated for the purpoſe, and ſo binding, that all the ſtrength of Sampſon himſelf could not have broken the tie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5440ba0f-9d57-469c-b4b3-afb91057348a",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "We guarantee by virtue of our power and the confidence of those who accept the guarantee; it is given by means of a word, which is accepted as a pledge for the future performance of a contract; [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c483f8d8-2ddc-4fd3-a3fb-2615f5d1a94b",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "Sir Isaac Newton was the first person to theorize that any two objects would be attracted towards each other by virtue of their masses, and that strength of the force of attraction – the gravitational force – would depend on the masses of the two objects and their distance apart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eca2312-5ac8-4b62-a9c6-b6b3c3c2cb63",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "England's domination of the first half was almost total, but they somehow contrived to allow Tunisia to raise themselves off the floor by virtue of rank carelessness from [Gareth] Southgate's side."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e481d328-b9bb-453e-888d-2c69f999afa6",
                                                "sense_id": "70707a9f-02d6-343b-b881-bbb909bb5124",
                                                "text": "For nearly the entire television age, his mother was the visual representation of royalty. His wedding was one of the biggest TV events of the 20th century, but he came first in “Charles and Diana” only by virtue of birth and, perhaps, the alphabet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c54f8b2f-8f7d-4c14-8182-b86170aac185",
                        "source_entry_id": "948ea7fa-9a27-314e-bd57-820d552c01e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "b3e15a1d-efbd-3ef3-bfef-3a6b4c265c9a",
                        "source_sense_description": "gehoben, veraltend, mit Genitiv: durch, mittels, wegen, auf Grund von, kraft",
                        "target_lang_word": "en vertu de",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en vertu de",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                        "entry_id": "ee05b5a7-a5a2-3b6e-8cfc-41110fbea4ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En conséquence de, par l’effet de, à cause du droit de."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0d3e536-870b-4d58-bd0e-137c725baf8a",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                                "text": "En vertu du règlement intérieur, il est interdit de fumer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7321142-bc35-4f2c-b7a1-3b2971fc1b64",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                                "text": "Il faut entrer de force dans le domicile du citoyen: il faut arrêter administrativement l’homme qui ne peut être arrêté qu’en vertu d’une loi ; il faut violer la liberté de l’opinion et la liberté individuelle ; il faut en un mot mettre en péril la constitution même de l’État."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41dd7bb5-3da8-4800-8514-b7097349f987",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                                "text": "Je m’empressai d’aller faire une visite au prince Michel, alors régnant en vertu d’une révolution, aujourd’hui précipité du trône par une autre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "967ded66-2bc9-4239-ac2a-3258c95f0a04",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                                "text": "[…], on chercha, dans le Midi, à les déposséder des biens immeubles qu’ils détenaient en vertu d’usages très anciens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d6a945e-4e92-4f10-b9da-3b08df68c76d",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                                "text": "Ces projets de loi de programmation ont pour objet, en vertu de l’article 34 de la Constitution, de déterminer les objectifs de l’action de l’État […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8134f21c-9649-453f-a25f-1dc10ebe06ce",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2d9e4f-7646-3da4-9968-95e03bfc216b",
                                                "text": "Monsieur Yacha Heifetz, au nom du Président de la République et en vertu des pouvoirs qui nous sont conférés, nous vous faisons Grand-Croix de la Légion d'Honneur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
